[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12900.389, "timestamp": "03:35:00", "text": "是的，狗狗会在车棚里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12902.389, "timestamp": "03:35:02", "text": "东西。嗯，对，到后面去。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12904.229, "timestamp": "03:35:04", "text": "入口就在那里。我可以让你使用"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12906.79, "timestamp": "03:35:06", "text": "厕所之类的东西。我必须得到我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12908.79, "timestamp": "03:35:08", "text": "进入屋内的唯一方法是返回。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12911.59, "timestamp": "03:35:11", "text": "通往我祖母那玩意儿的入口。全部"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12914.59, "timestamp": "03:35:14", "text": "我必须去所有地方"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12918.79, "timestamp": "03:35:18", "text": "在我家门前，移动大门"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 12920.616, "timestamp": "03:35:20", "author": "@Anti-SpiritArt", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/wYaIbwf481rN5bfgaxWnbUoh-faRynKzhqgZXK5WIvlx9DlMJJl0M6boNmqYwDkmuSY99pM-=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "you have your phone she can just make a call right"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12922.229, "timestamp": "03:35:22", "text": "还有一些其他的东西。对，两道门，然后就走了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12926.15, "timestamp": "03:35:26", "text": "一路骑到那里，直到自行车停在那一刻"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12929.19, "timestamp": "03:35:29", "text": "车库。你可以说那是汽车修理厂。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12932.87, "timestamp": "03:35:32", "text": "但对于顶尖人士来说，这是第二重要的事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12935.11, "timestamp": "03:35:35", "text": "当我们把它商业化的时候，我们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12938.229, "timestamp": "03:35:38", "text": "制造了第二辆车用于停车场"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12941.51, "timestamp": "03:35:41", "text": "还有一些其他的东西。所以我想现在我们称之为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12942.91, "timestamp": "03:35:42", "text": "自行车"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12946.63, "timestamp": "03:35:46", "text": "车库里有家里的车，还有我的……呃……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12948.63, "timestamp": "03:35:48", "text": "踏板车，还有我爸爸的自行车，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12950.63, "timestamp": "03:35:50", "text": "东西都在那里。所以，是的，全部"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12952.67, "timestamp": "03:35:52", "text": "从那里到后面的路"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12954.51, "timestamp": "03:35:54", "text": "入口但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12957.03, "timestamp": "03:35:57", "text": "为了拥有发言权，她可以打电话给你。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12959.91, "timestamp": "03:35:59", "text": "正确的。但说到母亲，嗯……"}]